# Justice's second ability counts any way a nonland permanent Bot1 controls is returned to its owner's hand, a token too
# (it goes to the hand for a moment before it ceases to exist, CR 111.7). Bot1 makes a Soldier token with a S.H.I.E.L.D.
# Deployment Drone (Black Lotus), casts Justice with Mox Sapphire, Mox Jet and Mox Pearl choosing no target, and on turn 3
# sacrifices an Aether Spellbomb to return its own Soldier token: one counter on Justice, a 3/3. The Spellbomb leaves for the
# graveyard, not the hand, so it adds nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
S.H.I.E.L.D. Deployment Drone
Justice, Vance Astrovik
Aether Spellbomb
Island x12

